Before any UI or module change in this repo:

1. Read `includes/ame_platform_contract.php` and `docs/ame-platform-quality-standards.md`.
2. Test targets: desktop browser, Android Chrome mobile view, Android Chrome **Request desktop site** (coarse pointer + wide viewport).
3. Every deliverable must bump `AME_ASSET_VERSION` in `includes/config.php` and keep `ame-platform-contract` assets loaded via `partials/footer.php`.
4. Never auto-change party balances on page load; use Party Amount Shield patterns.
5. Supplier due display: only `supplier_due_ui.php` (orange payable, green credit).

Minimum bar: **intl-100** — no shipping updates below this standard.